The source code used to build the DSMs called ModelGen Source (MGS). 
The tool used to build this model is called ModelGen.

In this release note we track the revision history of the MGS and 
the DSM.


1.ModelGen Source Revision History
==================================

20/05/2002 GW MGS 1.00rel0
--------------------------
Special ARM946ES DSM,  based on standard configurable ARM946ES rev1.1 
RTL. 

The following pins have removed:
   SO
   SI
   SERIALEN
   TESTEN
   INnotEXTEST

and added following pins:
   SCANIN1, SCANIN2, SCANIN3, SCANIN4, 
   SCANOUT1, SCANOUT2, SCANOUT3, SCANOUT14 

The top module pin list is the same as TSMC 0.18 process netlist of ARM946ES.
The Default cache size are 8k I-cache and 8k D-cache.


18/07/2002 EM MGS 1.01rel0
--------------------------
* Timing arcs fixed
* All the timing data in .tdef file are "1", used as place holder.


